{"id":"260aad3bc2408854","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-chow.md","title":"Chow parameters","display":"df-chow — Chow parameters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-chow","aliases":["27-df-chow"],"display":"df-chow — Chow parameters","depends_on":["[[27-df-truefalse]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.6 Definitions 9.5 and 9.8","source_printed_pages":"428,431","source_pdf_pages":"452,455","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-total-first-order-and-positive-arity-modified-parameters"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-chow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-chow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chow — Chow parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.6 Definitions 9.5 and 9.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"428,431"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"452,455"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-total-first-order-and-positive-arity-modified-parameters"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f)\">\\(T(f)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>。</li>\n<li>引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i(f)\">\\(c_i(f)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq i\\leq n\">\\(0\\leq i\\leq n\\)</span>）及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span> 另引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f)\">\\(\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f)\\)</span>；元组按下列固定次序排列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_0(f)\\coloneqq|T(f)|,\\qquad c_i(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in T(f)}x_i\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_0(f)\\coloneqq|T(f)|,\\qquad c_i(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in T(f)}x_i\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\\coloneqq(c_0(f),c_1(f),\\ldots,c_n(f))\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\\coloneqq(c_0(f),c_1(f),\\ldots,c_n(f))\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f)\\coloneqq\\bigl(c_0(f)-2^{n-1},2c_1(f)-c_0(f),\\ldots,2c_n(f)-c_0(f)\\bigr)\\in\\mathbb Z^{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n\\geq1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f)\\coloneqq\\bigl(c_0(f)-2^{n-1},2c_1(f)-c_0(f),\\ldots,2c_n(f)-c_0(f)\\bigr)\\in\\mathbb Z^{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §9.6，Definition 9.5（印刷 p.428／PDF p.452）与 Definition 9.8（印刷 p.431／PDF p.455）；已核对定义原文。本目录保留原先“总数在前”的元组次序，书中总数在最后；这是固定置换，不改变相等性判据。</li>\n<li>扩充 modified Chow 参数时仍将总数分量置前。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时普通 Chow 参数为单分量元组；modified 版本在此限定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，避免把半整数声明为整数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 与 $T(f)$ 来自 [[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T(f)","display":false},{"tex":"c_i(f)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leq i\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chow}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"c_0(f)\\coloneqq|T(f)|,\\qquad c_i(f)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in T(f)}x_i\\quad(i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\\coloneqq(c_0(f),c_1(f),\\ldots,c_n(f))\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"n\\geq1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f)\\coloneqq\\bigl(c_0(f)-2^{n-1},2c_1(f)-c_0(f),\\ldots,2c_n(f)-c_0(f)\\bigr)\\in\\mathbb Z^{n+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false}],"bytes":1753,"backlinks":[{"id":"8704f7cdcca763f9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,T(f),F(f)$ 来自 [[27-df-truefalse]]，$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 来自 [[27-df-chow]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-chow|df-chow — Chow parameters]]"},{"id":"48ab8e892a346161","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$w\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^n$，$W=\\sum_iw_i>0$；对 $t\\in[0,W]$，$f_t$ 与 $\\pi_i$ 由下式构造；$c_i,c_0$ 见 [[27-df-chow]]，其函数输入属于 $\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$；积分是有界阶梯函数的通常实积分，$i\\in[n]$。"},{"id":"18fe7220421a34b0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$、$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-chow]]；asummability 表征见 [[27-thm-threshchar]]。"},{"id":"200e7013fdc02d77","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$i\\in[n]$；$c_j$ 与 $\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}$ 见 [[27-df-chow]]，$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dual]]，同维坐标更新 $x[i\\leftarrow b]$ 见 [[27-df-variablepolarity]]。$\\pi_j:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathbb Z$（$0\\le j\\le n$）、$\\delta_i:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb Z$ 和 $f^d\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 由下式构造。"},{"id":"484f25b1605a2149","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$i,j\\in[n]$；$\\succeq_f$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，$c_i(f)$ 见 [[27-df-chow]]。"}],"outgoing":["98e5c19fe4a2b9e2"]}